#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""verify-blogs helper: launch, doctor, drive, and clean up one verification instance of blogs/.

    vb setup                      once per fresh worktree: npm ci in web/ (the only mutating setup step)
    vb launch [--fresh]           build every page, start session.py + static server + box's relay (local) on free ports
    vb doctor                     read-only: is the launched instance worth driving? exit 1 on any FAIL
    vb drive <feature> [...]      run a feature's recipe; transcript + artifacts into the run's evidence dir
                                    features: build plan cells embeds links connect nn-fit-remote all
    vb status                     print the run's URLs, ports, PIDs and evidence dir
    vb cleanup                    kill what launch/drive started (by recorded process group), remove scratch state;
                                    evidence stays in blogs/.evidence/verify-blogs/<run id>/

Stdlib only (run with the system python3). Browser drives shell out to `uv run --with playwright` from blogs/.
Run state: blogs/.session/verify-blogs/run.json (gitignored, removed by cleanup).
Evidence:  blogs/.evidence/verify-blogs/<run id>/ (gitignored, never removed by this script).
"""

